OL,3,GNEWSA'Pool closure is very scary and a
OL,4,Aprofound loss'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe closure of a swimming pool has been
OL,7,Fdescribed as "very scary and a profound
OL,8,Floss" for children, disabled people,
OL,9,Fand those who used it for physical
OL,10,Frehabilitation.
OL,12,FBabergh District Council said it shut
OL,13,Fthe 39-year-old pool at Kingfisher
OL,14,FLeisure Centre, in Sudbury, Suffolk, to
OL,15,Fensure the "safety of swimmers".
OL,17,FThe decision was made after surveys
OL,18,Frevealed a planned #875,000 programme
OL,19,Fof repairs and maintenance would not be
OL,20,Fsufficient and a complete rebuild was
OL,21,Fneeded.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
