OL,3,GNEWSA'Pool closure is very scary and a
OL,4,Aprofound loss'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have told the BBC the sudden
OL,7,Fclosure of the pool, sauna and hot tub
OL,8,Fhave caused upset in the town. The
OL,9,Fcouncil said it, too, was "devastated"
OL,10,Fand shared the community's sadness, but
OL,11,Fit had "no alternative".
